Task: Analyse Existing DPW Front Architecture for Manual Document Removal

The C-API-Specs analysis has been completed. Now I want to analyse the existing DPW Front codebase before implementing the Manual Document Removal feature.

1. Business Requirement

Users should be able to remove one or multiple documents attached to a particular Event ID / Request ID.

Expected behaviour:

1. Display existing attached documents.

2. Allow selection of one or multiple documents.

3. Display a Delete button only if the user has the "removalDocument" permission.

4. On clicking Delete, show a confirmation popup:
   
   "Do you confirm the removal of this document?"

5. If the user selects No, close the popup without making any API call.

6. If the user selects Yes, invoke the approved removal API.

7. On successful removal, refresh the document list.

8. Removed documents should immediately disappear from Document Management.

